{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18397","headline":"范成君撃洞阴磬 · 范传正","name":"范成君撃洞阴磬","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"历历闻金奏，微微下玉京。\n爲祥家谍久，偏识洞阴名。\n澹伫人闻听，铿锵古曲成。\n何须百兽舞，自畅九天情。\n注目看无见，留心记未精。\n云霄如可托，借鹤向层城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"范传正","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18397.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18397","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}